s include edible oil, extracting corn oil, cattle food, animal food, and cattle food cake. It also provides corn oil, and cotton and corn oil cake. In addition, the company engages in manufacturing, mechanized expelling, packaging, trading, and selling of maize oil (non-edible), maize cake (cattle feed), maize germ, cotton cakes, cotton bales, cotton wash oil, cotton seed, cotton soap, and gunny bags. Mayank Cattle Food Limited was incorporated in 1998 and is based in Rajkot, India."}}